{"id": "gO8N3L_aERg", "title": "Fire Drill  - The Office US", "channel": "The Office", "duration": 297, "auto": false, "lines": [{"i": 0, "s": 20.6, "e": 21.6, "en": "*door shuts*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 1, "s": 24.6, "e": 25.6, "en": "*locks door*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 2, "s": 26.96, "e": 32.0, "en": "Last week I give a fire safety talk, *clears throat* and nobody paid any attention.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 3, "s": 33.62, "e": 37.44, "en": "It's my own fault for using PowerPoint. PowerPoint is boring.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 4, "s": 38.0, "e": 43.08, "en": "People learn in lots of different ways, but experience is the best teacher.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 5, "s": 44.42, "e": 46.02, "en": "*pours lighter fluid*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 6, "s": 46.32, "e": 46.82, "en": "*lights cigarette*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 7, "s": 48.84, "e": 51.42, "en": "Today, smoking is gonna save lives.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 8, "s": 52.3, "e": 53.42, "en": "*flicks cigarette, igniting trash bin*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 9, "s": 55.4, "e": 56.4, "en": "*throws lighter fluid container into fire*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 10, "s": 70.56, "e": 72.68, "en": "Does anyone smell anything smoky?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 11, "s": 73.42, "e": 75.1, "en": "Did you bring your jerky in again?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 12, "s": 76.82, "e": 78.04, "en": "*clears throat*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 13, "s": 80.58, "e": 82.58, "en": "Oh my God! Uh.. Oh my God!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 14, "s": 83.66, "e": 84.32, "en": "Stanley: FIRE!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 15, "s": 84.46, "e": 88.06, "en": "Oh Fire?! Oh my goodness! What's the procedure? What do we do people?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 16, "s": 88.06, "e": 89.1, "en": "The phones are dead!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 17, "s": 89.12, "e": 90.64, "en": "Dwight: Oh how did that happen?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 18, "s": 90.64, "e": 91.48, "en": "Kevin: It's out in the hall!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 19, "s": 91.48, "e": 93.66, "en": "Dwight: No, we don't know that. The smoke can be coming through an air duct.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 20, "s": 93.92, "e": 96.72, "en": "Michael: Oh my God! Okay, it's happening! Everybody stay calm!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 21, "s": 96.72, "e": 98.94, "en": "Dwight: What's the procedure everyone? What's the procedure?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 22, "s": 98.94, "e": 99.92, "en": "Michael: STAY F*****G CALM!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 23, "s": 99.92, "e": 101.0, "en": "Dwight: Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 24, "s": 101.0, "e": 102.64, "en": "Michael: EVERYBODY F*****G CALM DOWN!!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 25, "s": 102.64, "e": 104.14, "en": "Dwight: No no! Michael No!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 26, "s": 104.14, "e": 106.64, "en": "Dwight: Touch the handle, if it's hot, there could be a fire in the hallway!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 27, "s": 108.98, "e": 109.96, "en": "Michael: What does warm mean?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 28, "s": 109.96, "e": 111.12, "en": "Everyone: *groaning* Oh my God.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 29, "s": 111.12, "e": 112.4, "en": "Dwight: Mmm, not a viable option.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 30, "s": 112.4, "e": 113.0, "en": "Dwight: What next?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 31, "s": 113.0, "e": 113.5, "en": "Michael: Don't Run!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 32, "s": 113.5, "e": 114.18, "en": "Everyone: *Murmuring in Panic*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 33, "s": 114.18, "e": 117.0, "en": "Dwight: Oh! Here's a door. Check that one out. How's the handle?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 34, "s": 117.16, "e": 118.22, "en": "Andy: It-- it's warm!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 35, "s": 118.22, "e": 118.84, "en": "Jim: K--go to the back door.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 36, "s": 118.84, "e": 120.0, "en": "Dwight: Well, uh, another option.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 37, "s": 120.0, "e": 121.2, "en": "*Everyone panicking and screaming*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 38, "s": 121.28, "e": 123.2, "en": "Dwight: Jeez! Ok! settle down everyone. No bunching!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 39, "s": 123.2, "e": 124.16, "en": "Phyllis: Oh! I forgot my purse.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 40, "s": 124.16, "e": 124.9, "en": "Andy: Leave it woman!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 41, "s": 124.9, "e": 126.2, "en": "Michael: Get out of the way! Go, go, go!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 42, "s": 126.2, "e": 130.22, "en": "Dwight: Things can be replaced, Phyllis! People, human lives, however, can-", "ko": ""}, {"i": 43, "s": 130.56, "e": 131.98, "en": "*Chaos and Panic*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 44, "s": 133.5, "e": 134.78, "en": "Oscar: Ah! My hand! That's hot!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 45, "s": 135.36, "e": 136.62, "en": "Andy: Aah! This ones hot too!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 46, "s": 136.8, "e": 138.6, "en": "Michael: Okay, we're trapped. Everyone for himself.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 47, "s": 138.7, "e": 139.8, "en": "Dwight: Okay, let's go.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 48, "s": 139.8, "e": 141.6, "en": "Everyone: *shouting* Out of my way! Let's go. Get out of my way!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 49, "s": 141.6, "e": 143.2, "en": "*Chaos and Panic*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 50, "s": 143.2, "e": 143.94, "en": "Dwight: Calm, please", "ko": ""}, {"i": 51, "s": 143.94, "e": 144.74, "en": "Andy: Get out of the way!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 52, "s": 144.8, "e": 146.4, "en": "Dwight: Have you ever seen a burn victim?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 53, "s": 146.9, "e": 147.6, "en": "Andy: Move it!!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 54, "s": 147.6, "e": 150.3, "en": "Dwight: Okay! Procedure, procedure. Exit options. Where do we go folks? Wha-- Use a what to cover the mouth?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 55, "s": 150.3, "e": 151.72, "en": "*MORE Chaos and Panic*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 56, "s": 151.72, "e": 153.7, "en": "Angela: *pulling cat out of filing drawer* It's okay. Shh shhh.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 57, "s": 153.7, "e": 154.2, "en": "*cat meows*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 58, "s": 154.2, "e": 157.92, "en": "Dwight: A what? A rag. A damp rag perhaps.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 59, "s": 157.92, "e": 158.52, "en": "*Oscar escaping through roof*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 60, "s": 158.52, "e": 161.34, "en": "Dwight: Let's remember those procedures. What are the options?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 61, "s": 161.34, "e": 162.18, "en": "*Pushing and Shoving*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 62, "s": 162.18, "e": 164.18, "en": "Dwight: Okay, that's the wrong way. We've already tried that.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 63, "s": 164.4, "e": 167.36, "en": "Dwight: Remember your exit points. Exit points people.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 64, "s": 167.36, "e": 169.0, "en": "Angela: Oscar. Oscar!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 65, "s": 169.0, "e": 170.24, "en": "Oscar: Stay alive! I'm getting help!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 66, "s": 170.5, "e": 171.4, "en": "Angela: Pull me up!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 67, "s": 171.4, "e": 171.9, "en": "Oscar: You're too heavy!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 68, "s": 171.9, "e": 173.3, "en": "Angela: I only weigh 82 pounds!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 69, "s": 173.3, "e": 174.42, "en": "*Oscar crawls away*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 70, "s": 174.5, "e": 175.2, "en": "Angela: Uh-- save Bandit!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 71, "s": 175.26, "e": 178.0, "en": "Angela: *throws cat into air duct and he falls out through the other side*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 72, "s": 178.02, "e": 178.52, "en": "*MEOW*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 73, "s": 179.14, "e": 179.64, "en": "Angela: OH!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 74, "s": 179.64, "e": 181.44, "en": "Dwight: How about 911? Anyone? 911.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 75, "s": 181.44, "e": 183.7, "en": "Michael: *tries to break open window*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 76, "s": 183.7, "e": 184.2, "en": "*SMACK*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 77, "s": 185.96, "e": 187.42, "en": "Kevin: *smashes vending machine with a chair*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 78, "s": 188.1, "e": 190.56, "en": "*steals snacks*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 79, "s": 190.56, "e": 191.06, "en": "*SMASH*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 80, "s": 192.36, "e": 193.1, "en": "Pam: What do we do?!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 81, "s": 193.6, "e": 197.04, "en": "Dwight: Use the surge of fear and adrenaline to sharpen your decision-making.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 82, "s": 197.04, "e": 198.7, "en": "Jim: Okay, I am not dying here. Come on.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 83, "s": 199.44, "e": 201.02, "en": "*Dwight lights firecrackers*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 84, "s": 201.02, "e": 201.9, "en": "*Mass Coughing*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 85, "s": 201.9, "e": 203.3, "en": "*Firecrackers pop loudly*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 86, "s": 203.3, "e": 204.32, "en": "Angela: What is that? What is that?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 87, "s": 204.32, "e": 206.32, "en": "Andy: THE FIRE'S SHOOTING AT US!!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 88, "s": 206.32, "e": 207.08, "en": "*Everyone Screaming*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 89, "s": 207.08, "e": 209.08, "en": "Phyllis: What in the name of God is going on?!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 90, "s": 210.5, "e": 211.0, "en": "*Dwight pulls Fire Alarm*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 91, "s": 211.92, "e": 212.42, "en": "Jim: Let's try this", "ko": ""}, {"i": 92, "s": 212.58, "e": 214.58, "en": "Andy: Yes! Yes, ba-- Yes, battering ram! Battering ram!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 93, "s": 214.58, "e": 215.08, "en": "*Oscar's leg crashes through the ceiling*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 94, "s": 215.08, "e": 216.7, "en": "Phyllis and Creed: Ahhhh!!!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 95, "s": 216.7, "e": 218.9, "en": "Andy: Go, go, go, go, go!! AHHH!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 96, "s": 218.9, "e": 219.9, "en": "*Jim and Andy ram the door with the copying machine*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 97, "s": 219.9, "e": 220.6, "en": "*Angela shrieks*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 98, "s": 220.6, "e": 221.54, "en": "*Everyone yelling*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 99, "s": 221.54, "e": 223.4, "en": "*Micheal throws projector out window*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 100, "s": 223.4, "e": 226.16, "en": "Micheal: HELP!! HELP!!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 101, "s": 226.16, "e": 227.84, "en": "Stanley: Oh God! I'm about to die!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 102, "s": 227.84, "e": 229.24, "en": "*Jim and Andy ram the door with the copying machine*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 103, "s": 229.24, "e": 230.68, "en": "*Everyone shrieking*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 104, "s": 230.68, "e": 232.68, "en": "*Dwight blows airhorn*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 105, "s": 232.68, "e": 234.54, "en": "Dwight: ATTENTION!!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 106, "s": 234.54, "e": 236.68, "en": "Dwight: Employees of Dunder-Mifflin!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 107, "s": 236.68, "e": 240.1, "en": "Dwight: This has been a test of our emergency preparedness.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 108, "s": 240.3, "e": 242.48, "en": "Dwight: There is no fire. It was only a simulation.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 109, "s": 242.76, "e": 243.5, "en": "Jim: WHAT?!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 110, "s": 243.82, "e": 246.82, "en": "Dwight: Fire not real. This was merely a training exercise.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 111, "s": 246.82, "e": 248.28, "en": "*Oscar drops down from ceiling*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 112, "s": 248.8, "e": 250.24, "en": "Dwight: So what have we learned?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 113, "s": 250.24, "e": 251.36, "en": "*Stanley collapses*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 114, "s": 251.36, "e": 253.2, "en": "Dwight: Oh come on! It's not real", "ko": ""}, {"i": 115, "s": 253.2, "e": 255.08, "en": "Dwight: Stanley don't have a heart attack! *everyone rushes to Stanley*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 116, "s": 255.08, "e": 256.78, "en": "Michael: No, no, no! You will not die! Stanley!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 117, "s": 256.78, "e": 258.5, "en": "Michael: STANLEY YOU WILL NOT DIE!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 118, "s": 259.0, "e": 260.5, "en": "Michael: Stanley! Stanley!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 119, "s": 260.5, "e": 262.2, "en": "Michael: Barack is President!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 120, "s": 262.2, "e": 263.96, "en": "Michael: YOU ARE BLACK STANLEY!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 121, "s": 263.96, "e": 264.78, "en": "Michael: I'm gonna give him mouth-to-mouth", "ko": ""}, {"i": 122, "s": 264.78, "e": 265.98, "en": "Jim: No, no, no! Don't give him mouth to mouth for this!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 123, "s": 265.98, "e": 267.54, "en": "Michael: He's going to swallow his tongue.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 124, "s": 267.54, "e": 269.16, "en": "Jim: No. Michael. Michael.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 125, "s": 269.16, "e": 270.56, "en": "Michael: Don't swallow it!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 126, "s": 270.56, "e": 272.22, "en": "Kelly: Michael get off him! Stop!", "ko": ""}, {"i": 127, "s": 272.22, "e": 273.28, "en": "Michael: I'm fine! Leave me al--", "ko": ""}, {"i": 128, "s": 273.28, "e": 275.68, "en": "*Michael bring dragged away by Toby, Kevin, and Jim*", "ko": ""}, {"i": 129, "s": 275.68, "e": 280.02, "en": "*Outro*", "ko": ""}]}